abstract: "A test copy of the textGrain-style LLM watermark OpenAI described (keyed vocabulary blocks, entropy-budgeted optimal-transport coupling), a hardened detector, a semantic retrieval index, a signed-output registry, and an attack harness that measures what survives 13 attacks. Software is licensed under PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0; documentation, data and figures under CC BY-NC 4.0. Attribution is required; commercial use requires a separate license (see LICENSING.md)."
